How many times will "I love JS" be printed by this code?

```javascript
for(var i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    console.log("I love JS");
}
```

How many times will "JS is fun!" be printed by this code?

```javascript
for(var i = 1; i < 5; i++) {
    console.log("JS is fun!");
}
```

How many times will "JavaScript" be printed by this code?

```javascript
for(var i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    console.log("JavaScript");
}
console.log("JavaScript");
```

How many times will "JS" be printed by this code?

```javascript
var i = 0;
while (i <= 5) {
    console.log("JS");
    i += 2;
}
```

How many times will "JavaScript" be printed by this code?

```javascript
var i = 0;
while (i <= 5) {
    if (i === 4) {
         break;
    }
    console.log("JavaScript");
    i = i + 2;
}
```

